erated camera slot (CAM-01) plus three\n68:  * local fixture slots, reference-image input via the validated guest binding.\n69:  * Text-only requests are rejected for this preset; it exists solely for the\n70:  * consented-reference batch.\n71:  *\n72:  * Model choice: happyhorse-1.1-r2v (reference-image-to-video). The checked-in\n73:  * adapter performs no per-model capability validation and the repo carries no\n74:  * offline documentation establishing that wan3.0-video accepts a\n75:  * reference_image input at a 5-second duration, so mapping the 5s\n76:  * reference-bound batch to the r2v (reference-to-video) model is the\n77:  * technically safer call. Verified offline via serialization fixtures only;\n78:  * no provider network call was made.\n79:  *\n80:  * Billing caveat (surfaced, never estimated): reference inputs can bill\n81:  * input duration — the adapter surfaces the provider's realized\n82:  * usage.input_video_duration as secondsIn, and Token Plan Credits may differ\n83:  * from list prices. Only realized console Credits are billable truth.\n84:  */\n85: export const CAMEO_DEMO_PRESET = Object.freeze({\n86:   presetId: \"cameo_demo\" as const,\n87:   modelId: \"happyhorse-1.1-r2v\" as const,\n88:   region: \"singapore\" as const,\n89:   resolution: \"480P\" as const,\n90:   secondsOut: 5 as const,\n91:   aspectRatio: \"16:9\" as const,\n92:   audio: false as const,\n93:   outputs: 1 as const,\n94:   autoUpscale: false as const,\n95: });\n96: \n97: /**\n98:  * Fixed server-side prompt for the STEP 2 cameo batch. Baked in exactly as\n99:  * owner-approved; never caller-supplied, never logged.\n100:  */\n101: export const CAMEO_DEMO_PROMPT =\n102:   \"Create a 5-second, fully 2D animated clip in the style of classic Scooby-Doo. \" +\n103:   \"Use the person in V2 as the character reference, preserving his glasses, hair, beard, and outfit, all fully drawn. \" +\n104:   \"In a spooky mansion hallway with crooked portraits, cobwebs, and flickering lamps, 