may revoke a host device (revokeHostDevice, demote + audit record); revoked hosts fail the registered-host gate. The guest joinPin here is an obviously-fake placeholder (000000), never a live credential; behavioural role coverage lives in the emulator tests (host_join.test.ts), not in this JSON. Legacy joinParty remains guest-only.\"}","path":"/private/tmp/orchestrator/cycle-12/fix-1/test/fixtures/join_roles_v1.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully: test/fixtures/join_roles_v1.json","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Wrote file successfully: test/fixtures/join_roles_v1.json"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false,"state":{"itemId":"fc_01a192c66a30775ca737ffd9650a0254"}},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"{\\\"callables\\\":[\\\"createHostInvite\\\",\\\"joinHost\\\",\\\"revokeHostDevice\\\",\\\"listHostVideos\\\",\\\"generateHostVideo\\\",\\\"getHostVideoPreview\\\",\\\"deleteHostVideo\\\"],\\\"createHostInvite\\\":{\\\"request\\\":{\\\"channelId\\\":\\\"main\\\",\\\"deviceId\\\":\\\"tv-pilot\\\",\\\"partyId\\\":\\\"pilot\\\"},\\\"response\\\":{\\\"channelId\\\":\\\"main\\\",\\\"expiresAt\\\":\\\"<iso8601>\\\",\\\"inviteToken\\\":\\\"<server-minted hi-... capability>\\\",\\\"pairingCode\\\":\\\"<server-minted 6-digit code>\\\",\\\"partyId\\\":\\\"pilot\\\"}},\\\"guestJoin\\\":{\\\"request\\\":{\\\"channelId\\\":\\\"main\\\",\\\"deviceId\\\":\\\"p-guest-1\\\",\\\"joinPin\\\":\\\"000000\\\",\\\"partyId\\\":\\\"pilot\\\"},\\\"response\\\":{\\\"channelId\\\":\\\"main\\\",\\\"created\\\":true,\\\"deviceId\\\":\\\"p-guest-1\\\",\\\"partyId\\\":\\\"pilot\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"guest\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\"}},\\\"hostJoin\\\":{\\\"request\\\":{\\\"channelId\\\":\\\"main\\\",\\\"deviceId\\\":\\\"p-host-1\\\",\\\"inviteToken\\\":\\\"<server-minted hi-... capability>\\\",\\\"pairingCode\\\":\\\"<server-minted 6-digit code>\\\",\\\"partyId\\\":\\\"pilot\\\"},\\\"response\\\":{\\\"channelId\\\":\\\"main\\\",\\\"created\\\":true,\\\"deviceId\\\":\\\"p-host-1\\\",\\\"partyId\\\":\\\"pilot\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"host\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\"}},\\\"notes\\\":\\\"Only a registered TV may mint a host invite (short-lived, token hash + salted pairing-code hash stored, party/channel/expiry bound, max 3 active hosts per party). The invite response gains a server-minted 6-digit pairingCode shown next to the HOST QR; redemption requires both halves and is transactional for a separate phone identity with the server-assigned host role; same-device retries are idempotent, other-device replay, expiry, guest PIN reuse, wrong/missing pairing codes, over-capacity redemption, and client-only role changes never grant host. The TV may revoke a host device (revokeHostDevice, demote + audit record); revoked hosts fail the registered-host gate. The guest joinPin here is an obviously-fake placeholder (000000), never a live credential; behavioural role coverage lives in the emulator tests (host_join.test.ts), not in this JSON. Legacy joinParty remains guest-only.\\\"}\",\"path\":\"/private/tmp/orchestrator/cycle-12/fix-1/test/fixtures/join_roles_v1.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1793463839286,"end":1793463841924}}}}
